    {
      "id": "r20261120-a01",
      "title": "Mia Helps at Home",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Mia is ten years old. Every day after school, she helps her mother at home. On Monday, she sweeps the floor. On Tuesday, she washes the dishes. Her little brother Rio helps too, but he is only five.",
        "Rio's job is to feed the cat. He gives it food and fresh water every morning. Sometimes he forgets, and the cat follows him around the house until he remembers. Mia always laughs when that happens.",
        "On Sunday, there are no jobs. The whole family cooks lunch together and eats in the garden. \"You two are great helpers,\" says Mother. Mia and Rio smile at each other."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "sweeps": "menyapu",
        "floor": "lantai",
        "dishes": "piring",
